      "writtenOn": "2024-01-19T00:21:40Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "One possible approach would be for RX BYTES to trigger a fetch+cache, and the other 3 to always use the cached value (or use the cached value if \u003c1s old)?\n\n[why rx bytes? because it\u0027s probably the most interesting value of the 4]",
      "parentUuid": "88c50caa_4d4e87aa",
